I think we shouldn't make this silent, and instead throw like we do for `turbopackRustReactCompiler` and `cssChunking`:

```
if (result.experimental.durableUseCacheEntries && !process.env.TURBOPACK) {
  throw new Error(
    `\`experimental.durableUseCacheEntries\` is only supported with Turbopack. ` +
      `Please remove the option from ${configFileName} or run Next.js with Turbopack.`
  )
}
```
